---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Contact — bbd.sh"
  description="Tell us your idea, your portfolio company, or the gap you're trying to close. Founders, operators, and VCs all welcome. We get back fast."
>
  <section class="border-b border-ink/10">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted mb-2">
        ## contact.sh
      </p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-8">
        Tell us your idea
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-ink/70 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Founders, operators, and VCs all welcome.
        Best fit: people with both capital and conviction. We get back fast.
      </p>

      <div class="border border-ink/10 p-6 bg-ink/5 font-mono text-sm mb-12">
        <p class="text-electric mb-3"># we're a good fit if:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-ink/80">
          <li><span class="text-electric">[ ]</span> you can describe the customer and the pain (or want help finding them)</li>
          <li><span class="text-electric">[ ]</span> someone on your side will stay engaged, not hand it off entirely</li>
          <li><span class="text-electric">[ ]</span> open to project fee, revenue share, equity, or hybrid</li>
          <li><span class="text-electric">[ ]</span> the project stays inside legal lines</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Fastest channels</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 font-mono">
        <a
          href="mailto:hello@bbd.sh?subject=[idea]%20"
          class="block border border-ink/10 p-5 hover:border-electric transition-colors"
        >
          <p class="text-electric text-xs mb-1">// email · preferred</p>
          <p class="text-ink text-lg font-bold">hello@bbd.sh</p>
          <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-1">one paragraph + one customer scenario</p>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://x.com/bbd_sh"
          target="_blank"
          class="block border border-ink/10 p-5 hover:border-electric transition-colors"
        >
          <p class="text-electric text-xs mb-1">// dm</p>
          <p class="text-ink text-lg font-bold">@bbd_sh on X</p>
          <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-1">short questions, fast pings</p>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://github.com/bbd-sh"
          target="_blank"
          class="block border border-ink/10 p-5 hover:border-electric transition-colors"
        >
          <p class="text-electric text-xs mb-1">// github</p>
          <p class="text-ink text-lg font-bold">github.com/bbd-sh</p>
          <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-1">our open source &amp; build log</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-ink/10 font-mono text-xs text-muted">
        <p class="mb-2"># don't ping us if:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-1 list-none">
          <li><span class="text-ember">✗</span> you want hourly outsourcing</li>
          <li><span class="text-ember">✗</span> your "idea" is "build a ChatGPT clone"</li>
          <li><span class="text-ember">✗</span> the work waits indefinitely on a future raise</li>
          <li><span class="text-ember">✗</span> the project is grey-market or red-line</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
